  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nレッスン続けてくれて嬉しいよ。調子はどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011005040020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "まあまあ……なんとかついていけてるかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100504/1011005040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011005040030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "でも……もっと音楽に合わせられるようにしねーと",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100504/1011005040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011005040040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あと、身体のコントロールだな\r\nやったことない動きばっかで。腹筋背筋鍛えるべきかも",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100504/1011005040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011005040050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──音楽聞きながらトレーニングしたら\r\nリズム感身に付くの早いかな？",
